		},
		{
			"id": "p-mobility",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1220,
			"y": 3870,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 300,
			"text": "### Mobility & certification\nWho can work formally in which market\nDecides which leads can actually be taken",
			"color": "#7C3AED"
		},
		{
			"id": "p-language",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1810,
			"y": 3870,
			"width": 550,
			"height": 300,
			"text": "### Language\nEnglish across project staff — level varies, room to improve\nNo native Polish speakers · hiring in Poland within a year\n### Cooperation\nExchange of experience, training, full-time allocation — not rotation between offices"
		},
		{
			"id": "m-it",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 40,
			"y": 4210,
			"width": 1140,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "### IT & security\n- No local servers: Microsoft 365 and Azure\n- Cloudflare at the edge · Zero Trust — access by identity, not network location\n- Works inside a partner's access standards and adapts the tooling\n- Tailscale mesh for distributed teams — under consideration\n- ISO 27001 in preparation"
		},
		{
			"id": "m-roadmap",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1220,
			"y": 4210,
			"width": 1140,
			"height": 260,
			"text": "### Digital roadmap\n- MCP servers for Revit and CAD applications\n- Validators for document workflow and issued drawing packages\n- ISO 19650 validation · ISO 9001 quality control"
		},
