			"type": "text",
			"x": 2640,
			"y": 60,
			"width": 680,
			"height": 420,
			"text": "### [confirm] items from the brief — kept off\n- Germany standby power partner: \"Guilder\"?\n- Rostock scanning partner: \"Cadgima\"?\n- Client of the Swiss Digital Twin for MEP\n- Polish projects, incl. Michelin — and the full list\n- Further countries for the network map"
