			"id": "x-held",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2640,
			"y": 510,
			"width": 680,
			"height": 380,
			"text": "### Held back — needs a decision\n- Ukraine: \"supporting the country rather than margin\" touches both the margin rule and the war-narrative rule\n- The brief names only the topics under Open questions; the question wording on those cards is a draft"
		},
		{
			"id": "x-rules",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2640,
			"y": 920,
			"width": 680,
			"height": 430,
			"text": "### Never on the board\n- Rates, margins, pricing\n- Headcount economics\n- Individual names — including TEBIN's own relationship owners — until further notice\n- Any claim of independence in words\n- The war as narrative — structural fact only\n\n**Session open:** format (live drawing or presented) · participants · length"
		}
